    Piece MUST implement idMembers and inherit from the appropriate field mixins.
    [👤semio📚py💻semio🔖domain🔖piece🛠️piece](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/py/f/semio.py/s/Domain/s/Piece/d/i/Piece)
